      "priority": "P2",
      "priority_reason": "Explicit HR wish ('half of them forget'); it removes a recurring nuisance but blocks no registration.",
      "acceptance_criteria": [
        {
          "id": "AC-01.4.1",
          "title": "Who gets the permit reminder",
          "given": "the employee has reached the summary step",
          "when": "the summary is shown",
          "then": "a reminder to bring their permit on the first working day is shown to every employee living in Switzerland who is not Swiss and to every employee living abroad, whatever their nationality (nationality is not asked of them). A Swiss citizen living in Switzerland gets no reminder. The reminder collects no data. HR words it so that a Swiss citizen living abroad can see it does not apply to them; this spec states only its purpose.",
